====== TP-Link TL-WDR6500 v2 / TL-WDR7800 v1 ======

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

TL-WDR6500 v2 is a dual band router with 5 fast (100Mbps) ethernet ports. Advertised as 1300Mbps for its 867Mbps (2x2) 5GHz band and 450Mbps (3x3) 2.4GHz band. Currently available in China, as an upgraded version of TL-WDR6500.

Someone has found that the OpenWrt for TL-WDR6500 v2 is compatible to TL-WDR7800 v1 [[https://www.right.com.cn/forum/thread-333060-1-1.html|Source in Chinese]].

